1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,820
"Listening to Dr. Cooper

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:05,320
(Penny:)has made me want to start
cutting myself again""

3
00:00:05,330 --> 00:00:07,030
(Leonard:)Yeah.

4
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:11,100
(Sheldon:)Good evening,
Leonard, Howard, Raj,

5
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,400
(Leonard:)freeloader.

6
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:16,400
(Howard:)So, how'd the lecture go?

7
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:19,210
(Leonard:)In a word, triumphant.

8
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:22,540
(Leonard:)Really? Triumphant?

9
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,480
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes, you should have
seen those young people.

10
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:27,550
(Sheldon:)Thirsty for knowledge,
drinking in my wisdom.

11
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:30,680
(Sheldon:)I may have changed
a few lives today.

12
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:34,850
(Penny:)Oh, please let
me tell him.

13
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:36,660
(Leonard:)I don't know,
I kind of promised Howard.

14
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:38,640
(Sheldon:)Tell me what?

15
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,230
(Howard:)Actually, we should
all share the moment.

16
00:00:40,230 --> 00:00:41,660
(Howard:)Raj, if you would.

17
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:47,030
(Sheldon:)Oh, tweets about my lecture.

18
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:52,240
(Sheldon:)Hmm...

19
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:54,870
(Sheldon:)That's rather unfair.

20
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:57,440
(Sheldon:)That's downright cruel.

21
00:00:57,440 --> 00:00:59,910
(Sheldon:)Plus, insects
have six legs.

22
00:01:01,110 --> 00:01:03,920
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I'm not familiar
with the acronym "KMN""

23
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:07,490
(Leonard:)From the context, we think
it means "kill me now."

24
00:01:10,620 --> 00:01:14,460
(Sheldon:)Well, I suppose everyone's
entitled to their own opinion.

25
00:01:14,460 --> 00:01:16,200
(Sheldon:)I think I'll turn in.

26
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:20,530
(Sheldon:)I didn't want to teach
those poopy heads, anyway.

27
00:01:24,070 --> 00:01:26,710
(Howard:)FYI, I think that's
what Darth Vader said

28
00:01:26,710 --> 00:01:29,810
(Howard:)just before he started
building the Death Star.

29
00:01:29,810 --> 00:01:33,450
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

